<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body>
    <table style="width: 100%; float: left; line-height: 30px; border: 5px solid #0000000d; padding: 0px 10px;" border="0">
      <tr>
        <td>
          <img src="{{SERVER_DOMAIN_NAME_HEADER}}" style="width: 100%;">
        </td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td>
          <p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">
            Date: <strong>{{currentDate}}</strong>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 20px; font-family: Times New Roman, serif; color: #000;">

          <h3 style="text-align: center; text-decoration: underline;">Settlement Letter</h3>

          <p><strong>Dear {{customerName}},</strong></p>

          {{!-- <p><strong>Loan NO- {{loannumber}},</strong></p> --}}

          <p>
            This is to certify that a loan amount of <strong>Rs {{loanAmtApproved}}</strong>
            was granted to you on <strong>{{disbursalDate}}</strong>.
            You have successfully repaid <strong>{{collectedAmount}}</strong>, the settlement amount, on
            <strong>{{settlementDate}}</strong>.
          </p>
<p><strong>Loan NO- {{loannumber}},</strong></p>
          <p>
            We would like to express our gratitude for working with us. The loan status is now
            <strong>Settled</strong>.
          </p>

          <p>
            We appreciate your prompt repayment and cooperation throughout this process. Should you require any
            further assistance or wish to use our services in the future, please feel free to contact us at
            <a href="mailto:{{info_email_id}}">{{info_email_id}}</a>.
          </p>

          <p>Thank you for choosing {{companyName}}</p>

          <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <strong>
              Yours faithfully<br>
              <p>{{companyName}} (A Unit of {{nbfc_name_show}})</p>
            </strong>
          </p>

          <p><strong>Note:</strong> - This settlement will impact your CIBIL score.</p>

        </td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td>
          <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #333; margin: 0px; text-align: center;">
            This is a system-generated letter and does not require any signature.
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td>
          <img src="{{SERVER_DOMAIN_NAME_FOOTER}}" style="width: 100%;">
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
